{"unit_id":"Veagau__dsh-amadeus-workbench#feature-1","repo":"Veagau/dsh-amadeus-workbench","commit":"d2def0847fcb5b8fb41c566a8d66edc221531cd2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Amadeus Workbench 的功能「快速面板导航」：工作台提供返回对话、打开插件管理面板及查看定时任务的快捷入口；点击对应按钮切换 DSH 面板，返回对话不会创建或发送消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.source.js:139-157","client.source.js:166-171"]}
